        theUserDeclaresToBeAwareOfAnd: 'The User declares to be aware of and to agree with the content of these Terms of Use, as well as all applicable institutional policies of Mundpay, including, but not limited to, the Privacy Policy, Anti-Money Laundering (AML) policies, Fraud Prevention, Information Security, and other internal compliance standards.',
